<p>A deprecated house is over run by an anomalous, self-perpetuating, rabbit warren and their poo. Their previous owners still occupy the house.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> No</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Tale</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Dark Comedy</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Two Foundation agents are sent to investigate a house overrun by rabbits in the Midwest. The house is found to have its own microclimate similar to the Pacific Northwest, and its ecosystem is self-perpetuating due to the anomalous rabbits. The previous owners are turned into rabbit people by parasitic baby rabbits.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> It’s revealed through the found documents, an owner’s journals, that they had two rabbits. Before they could get them spade and neutered, the vets office closed due to quarantine. Unable to be contained, going so far as to teleport, the male rabbits kept escaping and creating more litters. The owners hired the city compost to take their quickly escalating piles of rabbit poo.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Over time, firs, ferns, blackberries, and other Pacific Northwest foliage grows out of the rabbit poo at an expedited rate. The owners, and housemates, slowly turn into rabbit-people when parasitic baby rabbits burrow into the base of their skulls. (Similar to the Goa’uld from Stargate).</p>
<p>Two Foundation agents are sent to investigate the house and they traverse room to room to figure out the ill fate of the owners. They are chased out of the house by angry rabbits, and rabbit-people.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> A deprecated house is over run by an anomalous, self-perpetuating, rabbit warren and their poo. Their previous owners still occupy the house.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
