			<div class="content" id="post-content-4854671">
									

<p>So this feels very monster manual-ish, in that its about this horror that hunts people and only describes its behavior. This is a thing that controls your behavior and then &quot;kills&quot; you&#8230; which isn't super deep.</p>
<p>Do you have a narrative beyond merely this? Like a history of the car or its motivations? or what happens to people when they're taken away?</p>
<p>Also just want to point out that people are convinced to get in this car with a compulsion effect from the SCP and this is done ALOT on the site and has become a well trod trope. I would heavily suggest you drop this aspect.</p>

